"""Editorial notes for the most-searched airline pages (Ryanair, Vueling, Iberia), ES + EN.
Own content on top of the template sections: group airlines, how each one handles claims, typical causes and
what the case law says about them. Facts only, each one traceable to the Regulation, a CJEU ruling or the airline itself.
"""

R261 = {"es": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/ES/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32004R0261",
        "en": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32004R0261"}

